<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Almanij H1 96 profit up 8.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian Almanij H1 96 profit up 8.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1996 earnings (in billion Belgian francs unless stated):</p>
<p>    Non-cons profit				    2.7  vs  2.5</p>
<p>    Dividend income		    2.7, up 8.3 pct  vs  H1 1995</p>
<p>    Balance sheet total		   23.6, up 4.3  vs  end 1995</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian holding company Almanij NV is the leading shareholder of Belgian bank Kredietbank NV.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
